  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support the production of an expedited National Forest Inventory - forest management system (NFI-FMS), which will assist the Forestry Department with setting a sound baseline and transparent measuring and reporting on biomass, tree volume and the quality of forest resources island-wide. It will also facilitate the creation of critical inventory reports and analyses. An NFI- FMS will allow information on Jamaicas forest resources to be managed within a scalable central reposit</narrative>
  </description>
